/*
 * Indicator: Impulse
 * Author: Alberto Amador
 * Platform: ATAS
 * Version: 2.1
 * Last updated: 2025-05
 * 
 * Description:
 *   Histogram indicator that scores each candle based on multi-factor order flow logic
 *   to detect real impulse vs absorption or reversal.
 * 
 *   Evaluated components:
 *     - POC location inside candle body (contextualized by volume concentration)
 *     - Directional movement of POC compared to previous bar
 *     - Total delta (percentile-based)
 *     - Delta acceleration vs previous bar
 *     - Imbalance count (buy/sell pressure + clustering)
 *     - Closed auctions at extremes (potential reversal zones)
 *     - Volume dominance around POC (used as modifier, not direct score)
 * 
 * Inputs:
 *   - Each component has adjustable weight and percentile thresholds
 *   - Designed for scalping (M1/M5) in futures (ES/NQ)
 * 
 * Output:
 *   - Histogram (decimal score), drawn in separate panel
 *   - Optional score-based coloring (based on alignment of POC / Delta / Imbalance)
 * 
 * Notes:
 *   - Modular score logic with optional debug output
 *   - Scores are not integers (support for soft multipliers)
 *   - Optionally exportable or visualizable as lines in debug mode
 * 
 * References:
 *   - Auction Market Theory (Dalton, Axia)
 *   - SpotGamma (gamma/volume clusters)
 *   - VSA concepts (absorption vs impulse)
 */

